we want to develop some filter app on images (like what we have on instagram)
we have Filter interface that represent our filters
we have ImageView that just show our filter on images
we have a custom filter like VividFilter
we use some third Party library like avaFilter
that contain so many filter that we can use on our App!

Note: java has some standard class for Images
      but we don't use them due to simplicity!


problem: avaFilter like Caramel didn't implement our Filter interface
         (because it's a third party, we can't modify it!)
         so when we use:
         imageView.applyFilter(new Caramel());
         we will get error
         (it's not Filter type!)